{"id":30,"date":"2026-06-02T15:37:00","date_gmt":"2026-06-02T15:37:00","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/floens-demo-new.local\/tower-garden-growing-resource-guide-copy-5\/"},"modified":"2026-06-29T13:38:37","modified_gmt":"2026-06-29T13:38:37","slug":"why-kota-stone-continues-to-be-a-timeless-choice-for-outdoor-flooring","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/why-kota-stone-continues-to-be-a-timeless-choice-for-outdoor-flooring\/","title":{"rendered":"Why Kota Stone Continues To Be A Timeless Choice For Outdoor Flooring"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"blog-card__text blog-card__text--one wp-block-paragraph\">Even after decades of changing design trends, Kota Stone continues to remain one of the most trusted natural flooring materials in Indian construction. There is a reason architects and homeowners still prefer it for terraces, pathways, courtyards, driveways, and even commercial spaces.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The beauty of Kota Stone lies in its simplicity. It has a natural earthy finish that ages beautifully over time while offering exceptional durability. Unlike many artificial materials, it handles changing weather conditions extremely well and requires very little maintenance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For homeowners who want a balance between durability, practicality, and timeless design, Kota Stone remains one of the smartest long-term investments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"blog-card__text blog-card__text--one wp-block-paragraph\">At <strong>Jain Stones &amp; Tiles<\/strong>, we provide carefully selected premium Kota Stone collections suited for both residential and large-scale commercial projects where strength and aesthetics matter equally.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image si